<div class="orange-session">
  <h1>おかえりなさい！</h1>
  <p>Ready to practice Japanese?</p>
  <p>A little conversation every day makes a big difference.</p>

  <div class="grid-section">
    <div class="bubble">
      <h3>今日は何について話そうか？</h3>
      <p class="romaji">Kyou wa nani ni tsuite hanasou ka?</p>
      <p>“What shall we talk about today?”</p>
    </div>
    <%= image_tag "Hana-logo.png" %>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wave" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 48" preserveAspectRatio="none">
    <path d="M0 48V20C240 0 480 44 720 24S1200 40 1440 16V48Z"/>
  </svg>
</div>

<div class="cta-section">
  <h1>Let's talk in Japanese!</h1>
  <p>Practice naturally with your AI conversation partner. Friendly, patient, and zero pressure.</p>
  <%= link_to "Let's start", places_path, class: "navy-btn" %>
</div>
